  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to protection and basic services for displaced in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering local civil society to increase vulnerable displaced persons&apos; access to basic services, legal aid and psychosocial support (PSS), while promoting socialo cohesion and the active participation of the affected population. Overall objective is to provide multi-sectoral emergency assistance and self-reliance support to displaced persons in Egypt, ensuring immediate relief and promoting long-term sustainable solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
